  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You channel kinetic energy through your body, making you especially resilient to damage.</p><p>Until the start of your next turn, your <strong>Armor</strong> and <strong>Defense</strong> are increased by <strong>+1</strong>.</p><p>Additionally, you are immune to being pushed, shoved, or otherwise moved against your will.</p><p>Your <strong>Unarmed</strong> attacks are also no longer considered <strong>Ineffective</strong>.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration by <strong>+1 rounds</strong>.</p><p>Alternatively, you may increase your <strong>Defense</strong> by <strong>+1</strong> per extra success.</p><p>You can also increase your <strong>Armor</strong> by <strong>+1</strong> per 2 extra successes.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.spMYmh1p7gandhe6]{Force Attunement}</p>",
